'''{{D|Puncture}} Damage''' is one of the three physical damage types. Deals increased damage to {{D|Corpus}} and {{D|Orokin}}. Its [[Status Effect]] reduces enemy's damage output and increases [[Critical Chance]] received.

==[[Status Effect]]s==
===General===
The status effect of {{D|Puncture}} damage is '''Weakened'''. It lasts '''10''' seconds and stacks to a maximum of '''5''' times. Any stacks applied after the 5th will replace the oldest stack, even if the oldest stack has a longer remaining duration. Affected enemies will have a yellow aura.
*The victim's attacks deal '''40%''' less damage. Subsequent procs add '''10%''' reduced damage, up to '''80%''' at max stacks.
*Weapon damage that the victim receives has '''5%''' increased [[Critical Chance]] per proc up to '''25%''' at max stacks. This is a flat critical chance buff(like {{Arcane|Arcane Avenger}}), but does '''not''' apply to [[Area of Effect]] damage or Warframe abilities.

Enemies killed by an attack that procs {{D|Puncture}} may have a large bloody hole on where they were hit by the killing blow.

===Railjack===
{{Quote|Railjack <DT_PUNCTURE>Puncture Damage results in a Decompress Status Effect which temporarily reduces the Shields and Armor of enemy ships.|In-Game Description}}
The status effect of {{D|Puncture}} damage against [[Railjack]] space enemies is '''Decompress''', reducing the target ship's [[shield]]s by '''8.5% '''and [[armor]] by '''9%''' for '''20''' seconds, with subsequent procs stacking multiplicatively.

